            ORG CMPLRCRB
CMPLRCDS: ;@NUC-GLOBAL CompilerCodeStart PERMANENT CMPLRCDS
S9RDOF  EQU GNRTDRO0-GNRTDBS ; read-only data offset from generated image base
S9BRDO  EQU BCKPBS+S9RDOF ; backup address corresponding to generated read-only data
SRCADPT0: ;@NUC-GLOBAL SourceAdapterCodeStart PERMANENT SRCADPT0
